WEBVTT

00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:02.953
Easy Folk Tales. The Three Little Pigs.

00:00:02.953 --> 00:00:05.088
Once there were three little pigs.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:08.174
They left their mother's house to build homes of their own.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:10.901
The first little pig did not like hard work.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.937
He built his house out of straw.

00:00:12.937 --> 00:00:14.774
It took him only one day.

00:00:14.774 --> 00:00:17.391
The second little pig worked a little harder.

00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:19.502
He built his house out of sticks.

00:00:19.502 --> 00:00:21.206
It took him three days.

00:00:21.206 --> 00:00:24.217
The third little pig was not afraid of hard work.

00:00:24.217 --> 00:00:26.298
He built his house out of bricks.

00:00:26.298 --> 00:00:29.872
It took him many weeks, and his brothers laughed at him.

00:00:29.872 --> 00:00:33.465
One day a big bad wolf came to the house of straw.

00:00:33.465 --> 00:00:37.518
"Little pig, little pig, let me come in," he said.

00:00:37.518 --> 00:00:42.203
"No, no, I will not let you in," said the first little pig.

00:00:42.203 --> 00:00:45.129
"Then I will blow your house down," said the wolf.

00:00:45.129 --> 00:00:49.381
He took a deep breath and blew, and the house of straw fell down.

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:52.356
The little pig ran to his brother's house of sticks.

00:00:52.356 --> 00:00:53.743
The wolf followed him.

00:00:53.743 --> 00:00:56.916
"Little pigs, little pigs, let me come in."

00:00:56.916 --> 00:00:59.763
"No, no, we will not let you in."

00:00:59.763 --> 00:01:04.206
So the wolf blew and blew, and the house of sticks fell down too.

00:01:04.206 --> 00:01:06.979
The two little pigs ran to the house of bricks.

00:01:06.979 --> 00:01:09.051
The wolf came to the brick house.

00:01:09.051 --> 00:01:12.579
He blew and he blew, but the house did not move.

00:01:12.579 --> 00:01:14.788
He blew until his face was red.

00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:16.254
The house still stood.

00:01:16.254 --> 00:01:18.494
Then the wolf climbed onto the roof.

00:01:18.494 --> 00:01:20.858
"I will go down the chimney," he thought.

00:01:20.858 --> 00:01:25.363
But the third little pig had put a big pot of hot water over the fire.

00:01:25.363 --> 00:01:27.261
The wolf fell right into it.

00:01:27.261 --> 00:01:30.579
He jumped out, ran away, and never came back.

00:01:30.579 --> 00:01:35.035
After that, the three little pigs lived together in the house of bricks.

00:01:35.035 --> 00:01:38.295
And the first two pigs never laughed at hard work again.
